    },
    {
      "lore": null,
      "name": "Shokk-boosta",
      "rules": "In your Movement phase, when this unit is selected to make an <b>advance move</b>, you can use this ability. If you do:\r<ul><li>This unit can change that <b>advance roll</b> to a 6.</li>\r<li>This unit can move through all types of model.</li>\r<li>When this unit ends that <b>advance move</b>, make a <b>hazard roll</b> for each model in this unit.</li></ul>",
